eed not split as diagonal times unit upper-triangular.","severity":"would-be-fatal"},{"id":"lem-chart-bump-at-a-point-with-prescribed-support","concern":"The extension-by-zero step uses support containment in the chart image, but that alone does not guarantee vanishing on a neighborhood of the chart boundary. The pasting argument needs a stronger support-control justification.","severity":"would-be-fatal"},{"id":"cor-the-tangent-space-of-an-n-manifold-has-dimension-n","concern":"The statement assumes only an $n$-manifold, but the page defines $T_pM$ for smooth manifolds via smooth germs. As written, the hypothesis is too weak for the conclusion's objects to be defined.","severity":"would-be-fatal"},{"id":"thm-change-of-coordinate-formula-for-tangent-bases","concern":"The final step says the two derivations agree on 'a basis of germs,' but the coordinate germs are not a basis of the full algebra of smooth germs. The theorem is plausible, but that inference is unsupported as written.","severity":"gap-a-reader-closes"},{"id":"def-the-local-algebra-of-smooth-function-germs","concern":"The item introduces $C_p^\\infty(M)$ and formulas involving $M$ and $p$ without restating the ambient manifold and base point. The intended context is recoverable from neighbors, but the definition is not fully self-contained.","severity":"presentation"}],"alerts":[],"seams_checked":[]}